<!-- ===== Process ===== -->
<section class="section" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center wrap gap">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">How it works</span>
        <h2 class="display-md reveal mt-3">A clear path from scope to delivery.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost reveal svc-all-btn" href="/model-making-process">Full process <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="proc">
      <div class="proc__step reveal"><span class="n">STEP 01</span><h4>Goal &amp; Audience</h4><p>We define how the model will be used, who needs to understand it, and what it must help communicate, evaluate, or test.</p></div>
      <div class="proc__step reveal" data-delay="80"><span class="n">STEP 02</span><h4>Scope &amp; Constraints</h4><p>We confirm the scale or dimensions, detail, materials, lighting, display requirements, schedule, and delivery plan. Access, power, handling, transportation, and installation constraints are resolved before production.</p></div>
      <div class="proc__step reveal" data-delay="160"><span class="n">STEP 03</span><h4>Digital Preparation</h4><p>We review the available drawings, 3D files, sketches, and references, then clean, simplify, or rebuild the geometry required for fabrication.</p></div>
      <div class="proc__step reveal" data-delay="240"><span class="n">STEP 04</span><h4>Samples &amp; Approval</h4><p>When required, physical samples or mockups confirm materials, colors, finishes, lighting, connections, or function before full fabrication begins.</p></div>
      <div class="proc__step reveal" data-delay="320"><span class="n">STEP 05</span><h4>Fabrication &amp; Quality Control</h4><p>The approved model is produced using digital manufacturing and skilled handcraft, with key stages reviewed for accuracy, appearance, and function.</p></div>
      <div class="proc__step reveal" data-delay="400"><span class="n">STEP 06</span><h4>Delivery &amp; Setup</h4><p>The finished model is inspected, securely packaged, and delivered ready for use. On-site assembly, installation, and setup are included when required.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

